    chainRegion: 'Shin2022 coverage chain, scrolls horizontally',
    chainCaption: 'Each count is read from a hash-pinned record (the label and duplicate audit, the signal census review or the scored export), and each step follows from the one above it. Right and left are the instructed targets.',
